@startuml ref-event-target
title Target: one log, many readers -- the AI is one reactor among several
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
}

actor Human
rectangle "Session\n(org-task subtree)" as Session
rectangle "Change / Requirement\n(orgspec)" as Change
rectangle "RunnerSession\n(eat or claude-client)" as Runner
rectangle "DiffReview\n(result cell)" as Review

cloud "**Event Log**\nappend-only, ordered, cursored" as Log #EAF0F8

rectangle "AI reactor\nconsume since cursor,\nact, emit" as AI
rectangle "Rendered transcript\n(exists today)" as Render
rectangle "Agenda refresh" as Agenda
rectangle "Lint / CI trigger" as Lint

Human --> Log : NoteAdded, FileChanged
Session --> Log : SessionStatusChanged\nItemStatusChanged, NoteAppended
Change --> Log : ChangeProposed, RequirementAdvanced\nFoldArchived
Runner --> Log : RunnerStarted, RunnerQuit\nToolInvoked
Review --> Log : DiffOpened, DiffResolved

Log --> AI
Log --> Render
Log --> Agenda
Log --> Lint

AI --> Log : FileChanged, ToolInvoked\n(the AI is also a producer)

note right of AI #FFF6E0
  **Open question 1: interruption**
  NoteAdded arrives mid tool-call.
  finish / abort / re-plan?
end note

note bottom of Log #FFF6E0
  **Open question 2: ordering**  two writers on one file
  **Open question 3: backpressure**  queue / coalesce / latest-wins
end note
@enduml
